# The Warrior's Path (CoP 7-5): Al'Taieu's zone-in finish for a Galka (race 8) at Status 3 with the drained amulet
# and Light of Al'Taieu (GMs): AMULET_SHATTERED (7522) and OBTAIN_BUT_STOLEN (7524, Light of Al'Taieu); the amulet is
# removed, the light kept; the title, and the mission completes.
lists Altaieu/onZoneIn/1 Altaieu/onEventFinish/1
char zone=Altaieu pos=-422,0,-532 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0 race=8
mission Cop TheWarriorsPath current
charvar Mission[6][748]Status 3
keyitem MysteriousAmuletDrained
keyitem LightOfAltaieu
login open                              # 1
finish                                  # 7522, 7524; completed
